<p>The SBOM, the software bill of materials, has them. pip, its vendored requests and urllib3, setuptools and its copies, each by name and version, as a component identity a scanner can match. Keep this with the wheel and someone investigating an incident can see what was in the release they received, not the one you're building today.</p>
